@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber
actor Shawn
participant "Gym Buddy" as App
participant "HealthConnectAdapter" as Adapter
participant "Android Health Connect" as HC
participant "RENPHO / Other Health Apps" as Source
participant "WorkoutRepository" as Repo
database "Room / SQLite" as DB

opt upstream health app syncs data
  Source -> HC : weight / body fat / sleep / HR / steps
end

Shawn -> App : open app / refresh daily context
App -> Adapter : refresh(date range)
Adapter -> HC : check permissions + availability

alt permissions granted
  Adapter -> HC : read SleepSessionRecord
  HC --> Adapter : sleep records
  Adapter -> HC : read WeightRecord / BodyFatRecord
  HC --> Adapter : body composition records
  Adapter -> HC : read RestingHeartRate / HeartRate / Steps
  HC --> Adapter : health/activity records
  Adapter -> Adapter : normalize + deduplicate + map source metadata
  Adapter -> Repo : upsert health samples + DailyContext
  Repo -> DB : persist locally
  Repo --> App : current DailyContext
else permissions unavailable or denied
  Adapter --> App : health integration unavailable
  App --> Shawn : workout monitoring still fully usable
end

note over App,DB
Health Connect is optional context.
It is never in the camera-analysis critical path.
Workout monitoring must continue in airplane mode.
end note

note over Source,HC
RENPHO integration is indirect when possible.
Gym Buddy does not depend on a proprietary RENPHO API.
end note

@enduml
